@startuml
class Student {
  studentId: String
  +bookRoom()
  +cancelBooking()
}
class Room {
  roomId: String
  isBlocked: Boolean
  +block()
  +unblock()
}
class Booking {
  startTime: DateTime
  endTime: DateTime
  status: String
  +confirm()
}
Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking : makes
Room "1" *-- "1..*" Booking : contains
note right of Booking
  A booking must start in the future and may last up to two hours.
end note
' Student-Booking: one student may have many bookings; each booking has one student.
' Room-Booking: a room contains one or more bookings; each booking has one room.
' Assumption: a Booking is a part of its Room and cannot exist independently.
@enduml
